# An allow-list: the build context is the workspace manifests and the source of the packages the web
# app is built from, and nothing else. `vendor/` (the ISO, the extracted disc, emulator disks,
# reference captures), `analysis/` (decompiler output) and `.claude/` must never reach an image, so
# they are never sent; neither is anything else that is not listed here.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps/web/
!apps/server/
!packages/engine/
!packages/formats/

# Host build outputs and dependencies. `apps/web/dist` is built in the image, never taken from the
# host, where it could be from a different checkout.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vite/
# Playwright output: screenshots and PDFs of disc content.
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
# Safety net, should a disc file ever be copied into a source directory (as in .gitignore).
**/*.[Dd][Ii][Bb]
**/*.[Aa][Nn][Ii]
**/*.[Ww][Aa][Vv]
**/*.[Ii][Ss][Oo]
**/[Tt][Ww][Tt][Ww].[Pp][Nn][Gg]
**/manifest.json
vendor/
analysis/
.claude/
